# SparkFun hardware repo .gitignore (SOP default, v1 2026-10-12)
# Built from SparkFun_Default_KiCad_Setup + SparkFun_IoT_RedBoard-RP2350 / SFE_Repo_Template, modernized for KiCad 10.
# NOTE: Production outputs (gerbers, drill, BOM/CPL, panels, ordering instructions) ARE committed. Do not add *.gbr, *.drl, *bom* here.

# ---------- KiCad (local state, caches, backups) ----------
*.kicad_prl
fp-info-cache
*-cache.lib
*cache.lib
*.kicad_pcb-bak
*.kicad_sch-bak
*-bak
*-backups/
_autosave-*
_autosave*
\#auto_saved_files\#
~*.lck
*.lck
.history/
# sym-lib-table / fp-lib-table are NOT ignored: project-local libraries (ARTWORK_*, PENDING_*) need them.

# ---------- Eagle (legacy boards) ----------
*.s#?
*.b#?
*.l#?

# ---------- Agent / tooling local state ----------
.claude/
_*baseline/
_*_staging/
COMMIT_MSG.txt
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ---------- Editors ----------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.un~
*~
~$*
*.bak
*.tmp

# ---------- OS ----------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Icon?
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk
**/Claude/scratch/
